      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03736_mane_ex4",
      "japanese": "そんな{馬鹿|ばか}な{真似|まね}はやめなさい。",
      "english": "Stop doing such foolish things.",
      "notes": "〜な{真似|まね} used to criticize behavior",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03736_mane_ex5",
      "japanese": "{危|あぶ}ない{真似|まね}をするな。",
      "english": "Don't do anything dangerous.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03736_mane_ex6",
      "japanese": "そんな{卑怯|ひきょう}な{真似|まね}は{許|ゆる}さない。",
      "english": "I won't tolerate such cowardly behavior.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "COMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n・{真似|まね}をする (to imitate)\n・〜の{真似|まね} (imitation of ~)\n・{馬鹿|ばか}な{真似|まね} (foolish behavior)\n・{危|あぶ}ない{真似|まね} (dangerous behavior)\n・{猿真似|さるまね} (blind imitation, monkey-see-monkey-do)\n\nUSAGE NOTE:\n{真似|まね} can be neutral (children learning by imitation) or negative (copying without understanding, or engaging in unacceptable behavior).\n\nRELATED VERB:\n・{真似|まね}る (to imitate, to mimic)",
